voriš naglas", "en": "you speak aloud", "tr": "yüksek sesle söylersin", "fr": "tu parles à voix haute", "id": "engkau berkata dengan lantang", "ur": "تم بلند آواز سے کہتے ہو", "bn": "তুমি উচ্চস্বরে বল", "fa": "تو بلند می‌گویی"}}, {"text": "بِٱلْقَوْلِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَإِنَّهُۥ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَعْلَمُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلسِّرَّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَأَخْفَى", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "67:13", "tense": "imperative", "category": {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5254.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "And keep your opinion secret or proclaim it, lo! He is Knower of all that is in the breasts (of men).", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Sözünüzü ister gizleyin, ister açığa vurun; bilin ki, O, göğüslerin özünü bilir.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور تم اپنی بات آہستہ کہو یا آواز سے، وہ تو دلوں کی جانتا ہے", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Dan rahasiakanlah perkataanmu atau lahirkanlah; sesungguhnya Dia Maha Mengetahui segala isi hati.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَأَسِرُّوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "قَوْلَكُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَوِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱجْهَرُوا۟", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/42cb66e2eccc199c3318.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "govorite (svi) naglas", "en": "speak (all) aloud", "tr": "yüksek sesle söyleyin", "fr": "parlez (vous tous) à voix haute", "id": "berkatalah (kalian semua) dengan lantang", "ur": "تم سب بلند آواز سے کہو", "bn": "তোমরা উচ্চস্বরে বল", "fa": "(شما) بلند بگویید"}}, {"text": "بِهِۦٓ", "hit": false, "au